@flexiarg cascades/on-the-fly-cascade
@title On-the-Fly Cascade
@sigils [🌊/流]
@keywords cascade, derived, dynamic, query, context, slice, retrieval, Moran, AA, problem-state
@audience knowledge-base designers, agent-system builders
@tone design
@factor Energy (viriya)
@provenance M-apm-demonstration W.70; Moran 1971 (the wall-chart failure; AA as dynamic query)

! conclusion:
  Derive cascade edges per query, against the current problem state — the cascade a seat needs
  is the cascade FOR THIS PROBLEM, and most such relations cannot be pre-declared.

  + context: A seat faces a specific problem and needs to know which patterns apply and in what
    enablement order; the pattern set is large enough that a static diagram fails (Moran 1971:
    "a cascade of a thousand patterns would be useless" as a navigation device).

  + IF:
      The relevance of pattern relations depends on the problem at hand — the same two patterns
      may be tightly coupled for one problem and unrelated for another.

  + HOWEVER:
      An unwitnessed derivation is silent machinery: a cascade that existed only inside one
      query cannot be audited, reproduced, or learned from. Ephemeral derivation is acceptable
      ONLY when paired with use-receipts (see cascades/edges-earn-permanence); a derivation that
      feeds a dispatch must enter the dispatch receipt.

  + THEN:
      Compute the cascade slice at query time (lexical, structural, or model-judged relation
      candidates over declared skeleton plus context), hand the seat the slice with provenance,
      and receipt whatever the seat actually uses.

  + BECAUSE:
      Contextual relevance defeats static matching in practice (push recall's lexical anchors
      missed every technique memory relevant to a problem stated in different vocabulary); and
      deriving keeps the declared layer sparse and honest instead of bloated with speculative
      edges nobody will defend.

  + NEXT-STEPS:
    next[Define the slice query: problem state in, edge candidates out, provenance attached.]
    next[Receipt used edges into the dispatch record.]
    next[Never let a derived-only edge become load-bearing without promotion.]
